  "keyFeatures": [
    "BAML-powered universal LLM agents with type-safe structured outputs",
    "Multi-provider support (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini, xAI Grok, DeepSeek, OpenRouter)",
    "Comprehensive benchmark suite with configurable model combinations",
    "Advanced analysis metrics (ELO ratings, win rates, efficiency, momentum, error patterns)",
    "Interactive BAML playground for prompt testing without running full games",
    "Configurable game variants (board size, rules, validation)",
    "Cost-efficient testing with free OpenRouter models"
